# LF in every checkout, also on Windows with core.autocrlf=true: sh rejects scripts with CRLF, and
# git apply needs the patches byte for byte (they also carry binary hunks).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.patch -text
# Committed with CRLF upstream (Dynarmic's bundled xbyak): kept byte for byte.
/upstream/ZettaBridge/third_party/dynarmic/externals/xbyak/COPYRIGHT -text
/upstream/ZettaBridge/third_party/dynarmic/externals/xbyak/readme.txt -text
